--- !u!114 &1493787913
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1493787911}
  m_Enabled: 0
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8bd0e85c49e7fe545a74704a45195bf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1569847720}
  npcIcon: {fileID: 840515505}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1545194912}
  prevButton: {fileID: 536729653}
  skipButton: {fileID: 581501767}
  dialogueSegments:
  - segmentName: Cut Scene
    dialogueLines:
    - Welcome to the Vaccination Room!
    - In this room, you'll learn the basics of vaccination
    - Don't worry, it may sound overhwelming, but I'll be guiding you throughout
      the way.
    - Once you finish studying in this room, you should be able to identify the 4
      basic vaccines.
    - I'll also make sure that you learn correct vaccination points for each vaccine
      and proper vaccination procedure.
    - This module will also allow you to practice the necessary vaccination skills,
      promote proper vaccination etiquette, and of course, familiarize you, with
      the common practices in the professional setting.
    - I've prepared a few tasks to accomplish those objectives. You can check on
      the task board from time to time to monitor your progress.
    - I'm sure you're already raring to get started.
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
  - segmentName: Handwashing
    dialogueLines:
    - Without further ado, let's kick things off.
    - "Before we start, let\u2019s make sure your hands are clean. Head to the sink
      and wash them properly."
    - Head to your right for the sink and reach out to the faucet to wash your hands
    - Use the soap for a thorough cleaning.
    - 'Great Job! '
    - Now for the final touch, use the sanitizer!
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
  - segmentName: GlovesCoat
    dialogueLines:
    - Nicely Done! After cleaning your hands, take the gloves and wear 'em!
    - Check out the lab coats as well and take one.
    - Great! Now you're ready to move on to the vaccines!
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
  - segmentName: Vaccine Prep
    dialogueLines:
    - Head to the vaccine workstations
    - 'For now, let''s start working with a Canine Distemper Vaccine (DAP) '
    - It's the one with the red-orange label. Also, we'll mix it with the sterile
      diluent so pick it up as well, and place them on the tray on the vacant table
    - Pick up the syringe and draw up the entire liquid inside the sterile diluent
      vial.
    - DAP vaccine vial actually contains powder only so don't worry and draw in the
      sterile diluent to DAP vial and mix them together
    - Make sure that you don't pull out the injection right away and gently mix the
      vial by rotating it gently while the syringe is attached
    - This allows us to avoid clumps, and mix the compounds thorroughly before we
      draw up the mixture again.
    - Great Job! Let's proceed to drawing up the mixture now.
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
  - segmentName: Injection
    dialogueLines:
    - To proceed, draw up the vaccine and position yourself where you can easily
      reach for the dog's right shoulder.
    - 'Before anything else, take the thermometer and gently insert it behind our
      brave pup. '
    - Hmm... That's a good thing, he doesn't seem to have a fever.
    - You can now inject the vaccine on the lower right shoulder of our gentle fur
      baby.
    - Amazing! You're a natural at this and our fur baby was so brave! It seems he's
      able to relax with you.
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
    - {fileID: 0}
  - segmentName: Hallway
    dialogueLines:
    - Great job, now proceed to the hallway on the far right to check out the other
      room!
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 0}
  voiceSource: {fileID: 1493787917}
  audioFolderPath: Audio/Vaccination_StoryMode
  typingSpeed: 0.01
  cutsceneMode: 0
  npcAnimator: {fileID: 0}
  isTalkingParam: IsTalking
